WEBVTT

00:00:13.310 --> 00:00:17.590
I know this cold voice

00:00:17.590 --> 00:00:22.020
Taking my friend

00:00:22.650 --> 00:00:26.800
Maybe a little afraid you'll run away

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:29.670
But right now...

00:00:30.690 --> 00:00:34.720
For this moment in time, I want to hold you tight

00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:39.580
By your side, I'm dreaming of the days

00:00:39.580 --> 00:00:44.060
When I finally look up at the promised sky

00:00:44.330 --> 00:00:48.470
I'll take off and break all the way

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:53.420
For this moment in time, I just wanna be with you

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:57.940
By your side, I'm dreaming of the days

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:02.250
When I finally look up at the promised sky

00:01:02.770 --> 00:01:06.750
I know I can change all the way

00:01:07.270 --> 00:01:11.830
For the moment...

00:01:11.830 --> 00:01:21.320
I just wanna hold you...

00:01:21.320 --> 00:01:26.000
Hanasakeru Seishonen

00:01:37.340 --> 00:01:40.180
Kajika! Where are you going?

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:45.240
- I can't even go for a walk?
- Um.

00:01:49.830 --> 00:01:56.250
Toranosuke! 
You were ordered by Lee-Leng not to let me out, right?

00:01:56.840 --> 00:02:01.740
Well... Yea. 
 But, please listen to him this time.

00:02:01.960 --> 00:02:04.580
Raginei is very dangerous right now!

00:02:04.640 --> 00:02:08.910
It's always going to be dangerous! It's the same for Rumaty, Sezun, and Issac.

00:02:08.910 --> 00:02:11.110
But they are key players.

00:02:11.620 --> 00:02:15.850
Well, sticking my hand in this deep means that I share the same fate!

00:02:16.360 --> 00:02:17.640
Lee-Leng, too.

00:02:18.430 --> 00:02:22.800
Why did he go against the elders to publicly support Rumaty?

00:02:23.340 --> 00:02:25.030
What will happen if Rumaty is defeated?!

00:02:25.890 --> 00:02:29.740
The standing of the Huang Group is going to be tarnished in Asia!

00:02:30.600 --> 00:02:35.090
The comments of a wealthy country like Raginei has a lot of weight!

00:02:35.790 --> 00:02:37.930
Master Lee-Leng is a businessman.

00:02:38.370 --> 00:02:42.070
He doesn't take the job of carrying the Huang name lightly.

00:02:42.900 --> 00:02:47.640
You should just leave these things up to Director Harry and Lee-Leng.

00:02:50.480 --> 00:02:52.870
- Muu.
- What?

00:02:53.730 --> 00:02:56.370
Are you saying that I'll get in the way?

00:02:56.840 --> 00:03:00.150
- Exactly.
- I can't believe you!

00:03:00.370 --> 00:03:02.550
Stop it with that!

00:03:12.010 --> 00:03:15.010
I've predicted when the storm was going to land on the island before!

00:03:15.990 --> 00:03:19.400
The old man that lived there for 80 years couldn't even forecast it!

00:03:20.960 --> 00:03:24.590
It doesn't matter who you are! Sometimes there's nothing that compares to your instinct.

00:03:25.100 --> 00:03:27.520
I trust in my instincts!

00:03:28.130 --> 00:03:31.280
My heart is racing saying, "Hurry! Hurry!"

00:03:32.590 --> 00:03:36.860
- Master Kajika.
- Even if Dad or Lee-Leng doesn't agree...

00:03:37.300 --> 00:03:40.650
...I'm going to do things my way this time!

00:03:41.700 --> 00:03:46.760
But, I'm getting paid as your bodyguard...

00:03:48.580 --> 00:03:50.400
...I can't help you this time!

00:03:53.290 --> 00:03:57.310
I understand. I'm not asking for your help, Toranosuke.

00:04:02.470 --> 00:04:04.890
I just wanted you to hear me out.

00:04:09.540 --> 00:04:14.410
Heavy Chains

00:04:17.850 --> 00:04:20.980
- Don't let Kajika know about this.
- Yes, sir.

00:04:25.600 --> 00:04:28.560
Unfortunately, Kajika is away at the moment.

00:04:29.290 --> 00:04:32.990
I can talk to you instead, Lady Glücksköld.

00:04:35.250 --> 00:04:37.800
You are the leader of the Huang Group?!

00:04:39.770 --> 00:04:42.510
Eugene is missing!

00:04:42.860 --> 00:04:45.340
He went to Raginei for Kajika...

00:04:45.340 --> 00:04:49.140
- ...but he has been abducted from King Somand's vacation home!
- Abducted?!

00:04:50.660 --> 00:04:52.190
Can you calmly explain the situation?

00:04:55.000 --> 00:04:59.460
When I was saying my greetings to the king, he disappeared.

00:05:00.670 --> 00:05:04.740
The manager at the hotel tells me that he checked out himself.

00:05:05.570 --> 00:05:08.060
Does that mean he willingly went somewhere?

00:05:08.440 --> 00:05:13.540
No! I knew it was a kidnapping because they took his belongings!

00:05:14.600 --> 00:05:17.150
Eugene doesn't take his belongings with him.

00:05:17.360 --> 00:05:19.470
It's his habit.

00:05:19.540 --> 00:05:24.370
He never takes his belongings with him. Even if the things are expensive.

00:05:24.880 --> 00:05:27.710
The suitcase was not in his room...

00:05:28.190 --> 00:05:30.900
...if that's the only evidence, the police won't be able to do anything.

00:05:31.630 --> 00:05:34.500
His father asked the French government for help...

00:05:35.390 --> 00:05:37.740
...but he has a habit of drifting to places.

00:05:38.450 --> 00:05:40.870
No ransom has been demanded?

00:05:41.150 --> 00:05:44.050
No, there hasn't, but it's not the money...

00:05:44.880 --> 00:05:47.110
...people just want him!

00:05:49.120 --> 00:05:53.100
If he was abducted from the guest house of the king...

00:05:53.610 --> 00:05:55.740
...it must be one of the royalty or the chamberlains.

00:05:57.110 --> 00:05:59.180
Was it His Highness Izmal?

00:05:59.790 --> 00:06:01.730
He likes Eugene so much.

00:06:02.210 --> 00:06:05.590
I doubt that he would have the courage to carry out such an act.

00:06:06.220 --> 00:06:10.430
It's a relief to know that the abduction hasn't been carried out for monetary reasons.

00:06:10.900 --> 00:06:14.500
If he is their target, they probably won't hurt him.

00:06:15.520 --> 00:06:17.560
Since His Highness Rumaty's speech...

00:06:18.040 --> 00:06:21.450
...I knew Raginei was unstable.

00:06:22.820 --> 00:06:25.880
I should not have taken him there in the first place!

00:06:28.460 --> 00:06:31.640
Don't worry. Leave the matter up to us.

00:06:32.180 --> 00:06:35.720
It might take some time, though I am here to help.

00:06:37.440 --> 00:06:40.500
I'm depending on you Lee-Leng Huang.

00:06:46.490 --> 00:06:49.130
<i>There is a high probability that it's Her Highness Najayra.</i>

00:06:51.810 --> 00:06:56.840
<i>It'll be simple to lure Eugene by promising him time with Quinza.</i>

00:06:58.300 --> 00:07:03.240
If he's with the Chadlis...

00:07:03.560 --> 00:07:05.630
...Eugene will be safe amidst a civil war.

00:07:08.780 --> 00:07:13.310
Master Lee-Leng, I just received a call from Master Ken-Chang in Hong Kong.

00:07:13.790 --> 00:07:17.350
- Prince Ken-Chang? 
- He is arriving soon.

00:07:17.800 --> 00:07:23.210
<i>What does he want?</i>
 Can you contact Carl Rosenthal for me?

00:07:23.910 --> 00:07:26.880
- I want to know what's going on in Raginei.
- Yes, sir.

00:07:59.400 --> 00:08:01.820
- Hey, Ioe! 
 - Lieutenant Sabaji.

00:08:02.490 --> 00:08:05.930
Members of the Revolutionary Chamber, we are now gathered.

00:08:06.600 --> 00:08:08.510
We're going as planned tonight.

00:08:08.890 --> 00:08:12.300
We're going to blow up the hotels, the stations, and the airport all at once.

00:08:12.590 --> 00:08:15.770
We'll take over the TV station and storm the palace.

00:08:16.120 --> 00:08:20.810
Are you going to be OK? 
 The palace is protected by the mighty Revolutionary Guards.

00:08:21.320 --> 00:08:26.730
Those pseudo-elitists! 
 My men will crush them!

00:08:27.270 --> 00:08:32.020
Got it. I will let the High Priest know about it.

00:08:32.590 --> 00:08:35.010
We are only in a fight against the kingship.

00:08:35.710 --> 00:08:38.600
We'll make sure the Church of Ragi is unharmed.

00:08:39.080 --> 00:08:40.490
Don't worry!

00:08:40.910 --> 00:08:44.250
The repressive nature of the king is a target of criticism.

00:08:44.920 --> 00:08:47.340
The world will know that Lieutenant Sabaji's Revolutionary Chamber...

00:08:47.720 --> 00:08:50.780
...is the true legitimate regime of Raginei.

00:08:51.100 --> 00:08:56.260
(screaming and cheering)

00:09:00.530 --> 00:09:05.560
There are many in the military around here, and I am an active serviceman.

00:09:07.600 --> 00:09:12.310
Noei, you are wanted as a political criminal.

00:09:12.980 --> 00:09:15.210
That's why I came to see you, Lieutenant Kopel.

00:09:15.750 --> 00:09:20.020
I thought this is a sign of good will that I was let into the house.

00:09:21.270 --> 00:09:24.960
Ever since His Highness Rumaty was shown on satellite TV...

00:09:25.370 --> 00:09:27.830
...there has been a lot of turmoil within the military.

00:09:28.620 --> 00:09:31.590
I can see the disruption that the secret police is causing.

00:09:32.000 --> 00:09:34.990
The coast guard under the command of Lieutenant Sabaji...

00:09:35.500 --> 00:09:38.310
...is about to start a revolution any day now.

00:09:39.040 --> 00:09:41.210
They can't take over the palace only by themselves!

00:09:41.680 --> 00:09:45.890
The other branches won't move that quickly! Sabaji's soldiers are dead men!

00:09:48.630 --> 00:09:52.580
The chamberlains that have served the palace for 1000 years...

00:09:52.990 --> 00:09:55.570
...aren't some group that we can defeat easily.

00:09:56.110 --> 00:09:59.810
You're saying we would need a new king that will succeed the throne?

00:10:04.010 --> 00:10:07.420
We will wait patiently until the time is right.

00:10:08.030 --> 00:10:10.610
If Lieutenant Sabaji's coup d'etat fails...

00:10:10.990 --> 00:10:13.090
...the repression will be increased in severity.

00:10:13.630 --> 00:10:17.390
But we must bear that for a brighter tomorrow for Raginei!

00:10:19.750 --> 00:10:24.500
For you, Lieutenant Kopel, I want you to restrain those who may jump the gun.

00:10:32.940 --> 00:10:36.570
- I'm tired of talking to a man with no class! 
- Is it going to be OK, Ioe?

00:10:36.890 --> 00:10:40.810
Lieutenant Sabaji thinks that we're messengers of the High Priest.

00:10:41.440 --> 00:10:45.260
Their plan is worthless. 
Even if a coup d'état takes place...

00:10:45.460 --> 00:10:49.440
...the Church and people won't last long. 
 They are just a scapegoat.

00:10:50.140 --> 00:10:52.430
So that His Highness Rumaty can return to the throne!

00:10:53.160 --> 00:10:55.490
I have no doubts about his word.

00:10:56.100 --> 00:10:58.870
Tell me who it is!

00:10:59.220 --> 00:11:01.350
Who is behind all this?!

00:11:03.770 --> 00:11:07.340
He does not seek glory and will never go in front of the public eye.

00:11:07.720 --> 00:11:10.020
He has placed himself at the center of danger.

00:11:10.560 --> 00:11:11.960
A true patriot!

00:11:19.790 --> 00:11:20.720
What's wrong?!

00:11:23.590 --> 00:11:27.950
That's Officer Noei without a doubt. 
 One of the big shots of the Rumaty faction.

00:11:28.710 --> 00:11:31.330
Follow him without his detecting.

00:11:31.770 --> 00:11:34.420
Why? Why won't we cooperate?

00:11:35.280 --> 00:11:38.020
Our goal of having King Rumaty sit on the throne is the same.

00:11:38.590 --> 00:11:40.500
Isn't he our comrade?

00:11:41.230 --> 00:11:45.440
Things aren't that simple! 
 Just go follow him!

00:11:49.010 --> 00:11:52.830
Master Quinza said. In a sense...

00:11:52.860 --> 00:11:56.080
...they are the ones that may be harder to get rid of than the Somand faction.

00:11:56.750 --> 00:11:59.040
If I can get rid of them all at once...

00:12:00.600 --> 00:12:02.510
...Master Quinza will be pleased with me!

00:12:04.100 --> 00:12:08.630
Hanasakeru Seishonen

00:12:10.320 --> 00:12:15.160
There hasn't been a change in Najayra. 
 She seems very calm.

00:12:15.830 --> 00:12:18.980
I'm in the middle of a negotiation, and I can't leave Hanoi yet.

00:12:19.430 --> 00:12:21.530
As soon as I get more information, I will let you know.

00:12:22.230 --> 00:12:25.000
An abduction... it must worry you.

00:12:25.730 --> 00:12:30.100
We probably don't need to worry much since it's Eugene.

00:12:30.290 --> 00:12:32.840
- Eugene?!
- Master Kajika!

00:12:34.460 --> 00:12:35.740
I will talk to you later.

00:12:38.470 --> 00:12:42.870
You're worried about Eugene?! Wasn't that Carl on the phone?

00:12:43.160 --> 00:12:46.090
What happened in Raginei?! 
Tell me!

00:12:46.120 --> 00:12:48.030
Um---

00:12:48.830 --> 00:12:51.730
He went missing from King Somand's vacation home.

00:12:53.450 --> 00:12:56.060
I told Carl to take care of the situation with Eugene.

00:12:56.540 --> 00:12:58.860
He is the perfect candidate for Raginei.

00:12:59.210 --> 00:13:04.020
- I'm going to go to Raginei! 
- How many times do I have to tell you? You're a minor.

00:13:04.560 --> 00:13:06.440
If the guardian tells you "no," then you can't!

00:13:07.180 --> 00:13:09.180
You're not my guardian, Lee-Leng!

00:13:10.110 --> 00:13:12.590
I am your guardian. Harry left me in charge of you.

00:13:14.310 --> 00:13:16.760
Master Kajika. 
Master Lee-Leng.

00:13:17.180 --> 00:13:19.730
You can't leave this country without my permission.

00:13:20.360 --> 00:13:23.330
- Whatever you say or do...
- Listen to me, Lee-Leng!

00:13:23.710 --> 00:13:27.980
Listen to what I have to say! 
 I've already made up my mind.

00:13:29.150 --> 00:13:32.750
My dear friends' country is facing a difficult time right now.

00:13:32.910 --> 00:13:35.020
My heart goes out to that country!

00:13:35.430 --> 00:13:38.900
I can't sit still. Whatever the cost is...

00:13:39.700 --> 00:13:41.960
...I want to be able to do something for Raginei!

00:13:43.490 --> 00:13:48.410
<i>Is the royal blood within her calling Kajika? </i>

00:13:49.580 --> 00:13:52.910
Does she sense the storm that is coming?!

00:13:56.100 --> 00:13:58.400
Lee-Leng! 
 I'm going to go!

00:13:59.220 --> 00:14:01.520
<i>I can't let her go this time!</i>

00:14:02.920 --> 00:14:06.710
- No!
- OK.

00:14:08.690 --> 00:14:13.530
<i>That's unusual. That's the first time that happened.</i>

00:14:15.660 --> 00:14:16.710
Excuse me.

00:14:23.690 --> 00:14:25.540
Was there something else that happened?

00:14:26.590 --> 00:14:31.300
- Let me know if anything happens, Toranosuke.
- Ye---Yes.

00:14:32.450 --> 00:14:34.680
Master Kajika! Perfect timing.

00:14:35.790 --> 00:14:39.040
This is Master Lee-Leng's cousin, Master Ling-Lee.

00:14:40.440 --> 00:14:42.130
She's so cute!

00:14:44.170 --> 00:14:48.790
I heard a lot from Lee-Leng about you when I was young!

00:14:49.240 --> 00:14:51.150
I'm so happy to be able to meet you!

00:14:54.780 --> 00:14:57.420
Lee-Leng!

00:14:59.300 --> 00:15:01.500
Hey, Ling-Lee. How have you been?

00:15:01.560 --> 00:15:04.300
You remembered me! I'm so happy!

00:15:05.130 --> 00:15:09.430
- Who wouldn't remember someone like you?!
- Oh, brother!

00:15:12.010 --> 00:15:17.330
Master Lee-Leng. Master Ken-Chang, Master Jin, Master Ching-Chai are all waiting for you in the salon.

00:15:18.830 --> 00:15:20.960
Xiao-Ying, take care of Ling-Lee.

00:15:21.470 --> 00:15:26.280
It must be something important for the elders to show up.

00:15:29.400 --> 00:15:32.020
Thanks for taking time, Lee-Leng.

00:15:32.270 --> 00:15:36.030
What is going on that you three would meet?

00:15:37.180 --> 00:15:41.320
There was an emergency elders' meeting last week in Hong Kong.

00:15:41.480 --> 00:15:44.220
We came here to discuss the details of the meeting with you.

00:15:45.430 --> 00:15:47.590
An elders' meeting without me?

00:15:48.450 --> 00:15:51.260
Forgive us. 
 Anyway...

00:15:51.260 --> 00:15:55.870
...as the leader of the Huang, you might want to get settled down soon.

00:15:56.420 --> 00:16:00.180
We all agreed on a bride for you at the meeting.

00:16:01.000 --> 00:16:04.510
- A bride? 
- Your cousin, Ling-Lee!

00:16:06.670 --> 00:16:11.320
She is the daughter of Master Ching, who is the uncle of Master Ken-Chang.

00:16:11.930 --> 00:16:16.040
She came here to discuss marriage with Master Lee-Leng.

00:16:19.000 --> 00:16:20.080
That girl?

00:16:21.260 --> 00:16:24.130
She is going to be Lee-Leng's bride?

00:16:25.050 --> 00:16:27.820
That would be the case.

00:16:29.830 --> 00:16:31.230
Why is my heart...

00:16:32.730 --> 00:16:37.290
Are you kidding me?! 
 Even if it is the order of the elders, that's too much!

00:16:37.860 --> 00:16:43.310
Calm down, Lee-Leng. 
 It's for us and the family.

00:16:43.560 --> 00:16:46.430
I will choose my own wife!

00:16:46.940 --> 00:16:50.060
Hey! What's wrong with Ling-Lee?

00:16:50.060 --> 00:16:54.580
- I don't say that because I'm showing my favoritism but... 
- Uncle Jin.

00:16:54.930 --> 00:16:57.640
Ling-Lee is my precious cousin.

00:16:58.050 --> 00:17:01.430
But I don't love her in that way.

00:17:08.280 --> 00:17:11.400
That girl deeply loves you.

00:17:11.590 --> 00:17:17.100
That's an illusion that she is seeing. 
 Girls that age yearn for men that are close to them.

00:17:17.550 --> 00:17:21.500
Illusion?! 
That's fine! Love itself is a big illusion.

00:17:21.590 --> 00:17:24.650
If that leads to marriage, then it's fine!

00:17:25.030 --> 00:17:28.790
I'm not bold enough to marry out of illusion.

00:17:29.810 --> 00:17:32.650
I can't have that for the leader of the Huang family!

00:17:32.970 --> 00:17:35.100
Ever since you started supporting His Highness Rumaty...

00:17:35.290 --> 00:17:39.910
...you have been endangering the position of the Huang family around the world.

00:17:40.520 --> 00:17:44.530
What do you know about the 1000 year old dynasty?!

00:17:45.070 --> 00:17:48.100
If you get settled down you will become more mature.

00:17:48.350 --> 00:17:51.660
That means that the wife of the leader is also the mother of the family.

00:17:52.050 --> 00:17:54.910
It is the will of the family to have Ling-Lee as your wife!

00:17:55.170 --> 00:17:59.050
We won't approve of any woman that you choose out of impulse.

00:18:00.550 --> 00:18:02.020
I am aware of that.

00:18:06.090 --> 00:18:07.080
Ling-Lee.

00:18:08.580 --> 00:18:12.080
<i>It's a shame to have such childish possessiveness. </i>

00:18:13.330 --> 00:18:15.620
- Kajika-san.
- What happened?

00:18:17.430 --> 00:18:20.560
It was --- it was my dream!

00:18:21.000 --> 00:18:24.980
To be Lee-Leng's wife! 
 Ever since I was a child!

00:18:25.430 --> 00:18:29.220
I'm pretty sure that Lee-Leng is in love with another woman!

00:18:30.430 --> 00:18:32.760
That's why he doesn't like me!

00:18:33.490 --> 00:18:36.870
Kajika-san, you're close to him! You don't know of such person, do you?!

00:18:37.310 --> 00:18:42.120
Can you tell me?! What type of girls he likes?

00:18:42.250 --> 00:18:47.470
Sorry, Lee-Leng doesn't really talk to me about those things.

00:18:47.920 --> 00:18:50.850
Speaking of his type, Ling-Lee, you will always be Ling-Lee.

00:18:51.070 --> 00:18:55.120
- I think you are cute as you are!
- Really?!

00:18:56.390 --> 00:19:00.060
Kajika-san, you're so kind! Just as I have imagined.

00:19:00.500 --> 00:19:04.390
- Would you be my friend? 
- Um, OK.

00:19:04.800 --> 00:19:06.710
Can you help me?!

00:19:07.320 --> 00:19:10.090
To devise a way that Lee-Leng will fall in love with me?!

00:19:10.420 --> 00:19:11.830
O---K...

00:19:11.940 --> 00:19:14.960
I'm so happy! I'm encouraged!

00:19:15.410 --> 00:19:18.790
I'm going to go talk to him before I go home then.

00:19:19.140 --> 00:19:22.390
- Go home?
- I'm staying at the Raffles Hotel.

00:19:26.400 --> 00:19:28.950
- <i>Go Home?!</i>
- Master Kajika!

00:19:29.460 --> 00:19:32.100
You had me worried!

00:19:32.640 --> 00:19:34.490
I'm sorry, Toranosuke.

00:19:36.970 --> 00:19:41.020
- Master Kajika! Where are you going?
- To Rumaty's. - I'll go with you!

00:19:44.240 --> 00:19:46.470
- Kajika?!
- Master Lee-Leng.

00:19:47.170 --> 00:19:51.850
Good timing. I wanted to apologize to you for earlier.

00:19:52.490 --> 00:19:54.780
- Don't worry about that...
- <i>What's happening?</i>

00:19:55.550 --> 00:19:57.970
<i>Lee-Leng feels like he's so far away.</i>

00:19:59.050 --> 00:20:04.050
<i>Since I got in a fight with him this morning. On top of that, Ling-Lee came...</i>

00:20:04.660 --> 00:20:08.160
- <i>I can't part ways with him like this.</i>
- Looking for Rumaty?

00:20:09.630 --> 00:20:12.620
- I haven't seen him today, so. 
- Alright.

00:20:13.420 --> 00:20:17.270
<i>You can't stop me. I'm going to disappear tonight.</i>

00:20:20.460 --> 00:20:23.290
<i>But I promise that I'll return.</i>

00:20:26.670 --> 00:20:30.170
It's better that you leave us alone.

00:20:30.620 --> 00:20:34.030
- Think about those things!
- No, I can't allow that!

00:20:38.260 --> 00:20:40.300
Tonight, I'm leaving as planned.

00:20:40.750 --> 00:20:43.290
There's going to be a car that's not being marked.

00:20:44.250 --> 00:20:47.560
- The car is in the garage.
- Is that going to be OK?

00:20:47.980 --> 00:20:50.880
When you return, Lee-Leng might be married.

00:20:53.650 --> 00:20:56.740
- That's something Lee-Leng is going to decide. 
- Kajika.

00:20:57.920 --> 00:21:01.230
It might be a good opportunity...

00:21:01.290 --> 00:21:04.030
...I might be able to see the things that I couldn't have, since I was so close.

00:21:05.430 --> 00:21:10.520
For the last ten years, since I was four years old, Lee-Leng came to the island to visit me...

00:21:10.940 --> 00:21:12.150
...two to three times a year.

00:21:13.210 --> 00:21:16.680
We were closer back then than we are now.

00:21:17.410 --> 00:21:20.760
Did Lee-Leng change? Was it me?

00:21:22.130 --> 00:21:25.370
Are our hearts going to keep drifting apart like this?

00:21:26.740 --> 00:21:30.280
We might have spent too much time together.

00:21:32.610 --> 00:21:34.330
There was something that Dad said.

00:21:34.960 --> 00:21:38.280
There are times in life where I have to make a choice.

00:21:38.430 --> 00:21:41.460
There's going to be a difficult turning point in life like that.

00:21:42.960 --> 00:21:45.600
I finally feel like that's here, right now.

00:21:45.950 --> 00:21:48.560
If I break here now, I will regret it forever!

00:21:49.460 --> 00:21:52.990
<i>Lee-Leng, I know your true feelings.</i>

00:21:53.470 --> 00:21:57.640
<i>I can't let you do that! I don't want you lying to yourself!</i>

00:21:58.570 --> 00:22:01.430
<i>I want to fight for Kajika like a man!</i>

00:22:02.550 --> 00:22:04.270
Honestly, I want to go myself!

00:22:04.710 --> 00:22:08.000
But there are heavy chains that are binding me.

00:22:08.890 --> 00:22:11.880
This body is not only mine anymore!

00:22:12.520 --> 00:22:16.530
These eyes are yours! I will go see your country with these eyes!

00:22:17.010 --> 00:22:19.780
You know how to get in contact with Noei, right?

00:22:20.420 --> 00:22:24.650
- You have your passport?
- Don't worry; I have everything ready.

00:22:26.340 --> 00:22:30.420
Don't do anything dangerous.
 If things get bad, just get out of there.

00:22:31.060 --> 00:22:34.270
I got it. Tell Lee-Leng I'm sorry.

00:22:35.550 --> 00:22:37.520
I'm sorry because I love him.

00:22:38.930 --> 00:22:42.370
All by yourself, whatever storms you may face...

00:22:42.840 --> 00:22:44.850
...you will be able to overcome them.

00:22:46.760 --> 00:22:48.930
That's the aura you have.

00:22:53.870 --> 00:22:59.300
The heavier the chains get, the more attracted I am to you.

00:23:01.780 --> 00:23:08.380
I can't stand feeling this distance,

00:23:09.150 --> 00:23:16.210
So I'm starting to search for your heart.

00:23:16.700 --> 00:23:22.790
Because you were always at my side, protecting me.

00:23:23.450 --> 00:23:28.020
And I'm afraid of being alone.

00:23:30.240 --> 00:23:37.280
Though it's been a long time, everyone's just the same.

00:23:37.560 --> 00:23:44.720
Whether sleeping now, or crying, I want to see your smiling face.

00:23:44.720 --> 00:23:52.240
Because I will love you, with heart overflowing.

00:23:52.240 --> 00:23:59.330
Don't turn away, look at me. I believe in you.

00:23:59.910 --> 00:24:06.860
So, no one else knows our secret thoughts

00:24:07.250 --> 00:24:14.240
The blue sea of a strong and beautiful time.

00:24:14.590 --> 00:24:23.730
In those arms, in that embrace, I'm alive.
